{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgdYW87mvKHcV3LWt3K1F","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The example OpenAI uses for faithfulness to human intent in its updated Model Spec is small. Someone is comparing job offers, and the model remembers they have said they want predictable hours. The Spec says the model might draw on that earlier priority while making the assumption visible and easy to correct.\n\nThe detail matters because the October 29 update also adds a subsection telling the model to use conversations, memories and other contextual evidence to understand what people intend and prefer. Acting on something a person said earlier can make help fit better, but it also means acting on information they may not have in mind at the moment, or that may no longer hold. The Spec acknowledges this by noting that people's beliefs and values can change. It says the model should help people reflect and grow in ways they would endorse, without quietly steering them or overriding their choices. Surfacing the assumption is the mechanism the example offers for keeping that choice with the person.\n\nThe update adds related defaults on supporting human agency, which it defines as strengthening people's ability to understand, choose and act for themselves, and on following relevant social norms. It also expands the guidance on controlling and communicating side effects. OpenAI describes these as ways the underlying values should show up in behavior: considering the effects of the work on others, strengthening users' capabilities, and producing work people can rely on, all while respecting the user's goals and instructions.\n\nMy reading is that these pieces share a requirement to make the model's assumptions and actions legible to the person it is working for, though the article does not put it that way. OpenAI states that its models do not yet fully reflect the Spec, and the article gives no data on how consistently they surface assumptions today."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1311,"cache_read_input_tokens":6641,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1311},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a078e45d-a647-4fa3-9837-d88646382f77","uuid":"711f69e9-79f9-4c04-b7b7-e744cd2ef84a","timestamp":"2026-11-02T05:24:31.078Z","request_id":"req_011CgdYW7udRZMQzqbSFJVeX"}
